      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHA TIN KING (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (23.36) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to his name from nine starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MINTER DELICIOUS (6) turned in a solid run last start over 425m at Bendigo finishing 5th and beaten only 3 lengths (24.46). Has ability and is one of the better chances. WELLERMAN (1) has missed the frame at his last two but did run well three back when third (17.25) in a Grade 5 at Healesville. Can turn it around this time. NALA'S MANTIS (8) looks an each-way chance.",
